.Dd October 27, 2026
.Dt TAILSPIN 1
.Os Darwin
.Sh NAME
.Nm tailspin
.Nd configure, save and print tailspin output
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Cm info | enable | disable
.Nm
.Cm set Ar setting value
.Nm
.Cm reset Op Ar setting
.Nm
.Cm save Op Fl r Ar reason Op Fl l Ar seconds Op Fl n Ar path
.Nm
.Cm augment | stat Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
provides the command-line interface to the tailspin tracing service. Configuration
is persistent and may be redirected for testing with the
environment variable.
.Sh SETTINGS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Cm buffer-size
Kernel trace buffer size in megabytes.
.It Cm ktrace-filter-descriptor
Kdebug filter description, including
.Ql ALL
and class/subclass selectors.
.It Cm oncore-sampling-period
On-core sampling period in nanoseconds, or
.Ql disabled .
.It Cm full-system-sampling-period
Full-system sampling period in nanoseconds, or
.Ql disabled .
.It Cm sampling-option
Comma-separated sampling options.
.It Cm cputrace
Enable or disable CPU trace collection with
.Ql 1
or
.Ql 0 .
.El
